@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@eventToken = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@eventId = 1
@registrationId = 1
@emailToken = paste-the-email-token-here

### Public QR self check-in; the event token is printed in the staff page
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkin/{{eventToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "participant@example.it",
  "isEatingPizza": true,
  "lactoseIntolerant": false
}

### Confirm using the one-time token from the confirmation email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkin/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{emailToken}}"
}

### Request an event registration from an authenticated account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEatingPizza": true,
  "lactoseIntolerant": true
}

### List event participants (CanCheckIn or SuperUser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/speaker/events/{{eventId}}/attendees

### Add a participant (CanCheckIn or SuperUser)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/speaker/events/{{eventId}}/attendees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-participant@example.it",
  "isEatingPizza": false,
  "lactoseIntolerant": false
}

### Manually check in a confirmed participant (event day only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/speaker/events/{{eventId}}/attendees/{{registrationId}}/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{}
